<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>WhatsApp Bubble — Smart Timestamp</title>
<style>
  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

  body {
    font-family: -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    background: #0b141a;
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 40px 20px;
    gap: 48px;
  }

  h2 {
    color: #8696a0;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 1.2px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .demo-group {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-end;
    gap: 4px;
  }

  /* ─── Base Bubble ─────────────────────────────────────── */
  .bubble {
    position: relative;
    background: #005c4b;
    color: #e9edef;
    font-size: 14.2px;
    line-height: 1.45;
    border-radius: 7.5px 7.5px 0 7.5px;
    padding: 6px 7px 8px 9px;
    max-width: 320px;
    word-break: break-word;
  }

  /* ─── Telegram-style bottom-right tail (SVG) ─────────── */
  .bubble::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 0;
    right: -8px;
    width: 9px;
    height: 13px;
    background: #005c4b;
    clip-path: polygon(0 0, 0 100%, 100% 100%);
  }

  /* ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  /* MODE 1 — INLINE TIMESTAMP                              */
  /* fits on the same line as the last word of text         */
  /* ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .bubble.mode-inline .inner {
    display: inline;
  }

  .bubble.mode-inline .ts-inline {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    gap: 3px;
    margin-left: 5px;
    vertical-align: bottom;
    white-space: nowrap;
    color: rgba(233,237,239,.75);
    font-size: 11px;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  /* ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  /* MODE 2 — RESERVED-SPACE INLINE TIMESTAMP               */
  /* invisible spacer pushes text so timestamp hugs right   */
  /* ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .bubble.mode-reserved {
    padding-bottom: 6px;
  }

  .bubble.mode-reserved .ts-spacer {
    /* invisible placeholder same width as the stamp */
    display: inline-block;
    width: 62px;  /* match .ts-float width */
    height: 1px;
    margin-left: 4px;
  }

  .bubble.mode-reserved .ts-float {
    position: absolute;
    right: 7px;
    bottom: 5px;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 3px;
    white-space: nowrap;
    color: rgba(233,237,239,.75);
    font-size: 11px;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  /* ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  /* MODE 3 — WRAPPED TIMESTAMP                             */
  /* sits on its own line, right-aligned                    */
  /* ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .bubble.mode-wrapped .ts-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 3px;
    margin-top: 2px;
    color: rgba(233,237,239,.75);
    font-size: 11px;
    line-height: 1;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  /* ─── SVG tick icons ──────────────────────────────────── */
  .tick { display: inline-block; flex-shrink: 0; }

  /* ─── Page label ─────────────────────────────────────── */
  .label {
    color: #8696a0;
    font-size: 11px;
    text-align: right;
    margin-top: 3px;
    letter-spacing: .3px;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<!-- DEMO 1 — INLINE                                        -->
<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<div class="demo-group">
  <h2>Mode 1 · Inline</h2>

  <div class="bubble mode-inline">
    <span class="inner">Hey!</span><span class="ts-inline">
      10:41 PM
      <!-- double blue tick -->
      <svg class="tick" width="16" height="11" viewBox="0 0 16 11" fill="none">
        <path d="M1 5.5L4.5 9 10 2" stroke="#53bdeb" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
        <path d="M5 5.5L8.5 9 14 2" stroke="#53bdeb" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
      </svg>
    </span>
  </div>
  <div class="label">Inline — timestamp follows last word</div>
</div>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<!-- DEMO 2 — RESERVED SPACE (wrapping text, no own line)  -->
<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<div class="demo-group">
  <h2>Mode 2 · Reserved-space Inline</h2>

  <div class="bubble mode-reserved">
    This message is a bit longer and wraps to a second line but the timestamp still stays right at the edge.<span class="ts-spacer"></span>
    <span class="ts-float">
      10:41 PM
      <svg class="tick" width="16" height="11" viewBox="0 0 16 11" fill="none">
        <path d="M1 5.5L4.5 9 10 2" stroke="#53bdeb" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
        <path d="M5 5.5L8.5 9 14 2" stroke="#53bdeb" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
      </svg>
    </span>
  </div>
  <div class="label">Spacer reserves room · timestamp floats to right edge</div>
</div>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<!-- DEMO 3 — WRAPPED (own line)                           -->
<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<div class="demo-group">
  <h2>Mode 3 · Wrapped</h2>

  <div class="bubble mode-wrapped">
    <div>
      This is a very long message that fills the bubble completely and leaves absolutely no horizontal room even after reserving space for the timestamp, so it gets its own dedicated line.
    </div>
    <div class="ts-row">
      10:41 PM
      <svg class="tick" width="16" height="11" viewBox="0 0 16 11" fill="none">
        <path d="M1 5.5L4.5 9 10 2" stroke="#53bdeb" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
        <path d="M5 5.5L8.5 9 14 2" stroke="#53bdeb" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
      </svg>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="label">Timestamp on its own right-aligned row</div>
</div>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<!-- DEMO 4 — SINGLE TICK (sent, unread)                   -->
<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<div class="demo-group">
  <h2>Bonus · Single Tick (sent)</h2>

  <div class="bubble mode-inline">
    <span class="inner">On my way 🚗</span><span class="ts-inline">
      10:44 PM
      <svg class="tick" width="9" height="11" viewBox="0 0 9 11" fill="none">
        <path d="M1 5.5L3.8 8.5 8 2" stroke="rgba(233,237,239,.75)" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
      </svg>
    </span>
  </div>
  <div class="label">Single grey tick — delivered to server</div>
</div>

</body>
</html>

